    "title": "MICROSERVICE-batchinsertion-List Hotel Loyalty Points Expires-v2-spec",
    "description": "The Hotel Loyalty Points Expiration Monitoring API provides a way for businesses to track and manage expiration dates for loyalty points accrued by customers. This API allows users to retrieve lists of loyalty points that are nearing expiration, enabling proactive communication with customers to enhance engagement. Typical consumers include hotel management systems and customer relationship management platforms looking to improve customer retention and satisfaction. By utilizing this API, businesses can ensure that their clients are informed and encouraged to redeem their points before they expire.",
